Z||000007||tellron||05-28-2001||09:43 PM||||Everybody is correct. I purchased mine from Suncoast Pontiac in Sarasota FL. The Suncoast Fiero Club has worked out a deal with the Parts Manager there to provide us with greatly reduced prices. Steve Vanessen sold me both 20606220 RH and 20606221 LH for $23.85 each plus tax. I live in Tampa Fl so he shipped them UPS to my house. As long as you mention that you belong to a Fiero Club, he will help you out on the price. You may have to pay to have them shipped to your location. Hope this helps you out. <BR>Fieros Forever!||||reg||6
Z||000008||tellron||05-28-2001||09:51 PM||||After that long post I forgot to give you any information as to how to get ahold of them.<BR>Steven Van Essen<BR>email: gmckeehan@automaxplus.com<BR>web page: <A HREF="http://www.e-partssales.com" TARGET=_blank>www.e-partssales.com</A> <BR>bus phone: 941-922-3553<BR>fax: 941-925-2270<BR>address: <BR>Suncoast Pontiac<BR>5005 South Tamiami Trail<BR>Sarasota, FL 34231<BR>Tell him Ron Hale from Suncoast Fieros sent you!<BR>||||reg||6
